Real CVs live here and are gitignored - they are personal data.

The directory itself is tracked because `tools/_shared.repo_root()` locates the
repository by walking up until it finds this path. Without the folder in a clean
checkout, every test that touches `output_dir()` or `load_resume()` passes
locally and fails in CI.

To run the app from a fresh clone, copy the fictional samples in
`data/samples/resumes/` here, or drop in your own as `<profile>.md` -
`automotive_cyber.md`, `devops.md`, `ai_eng.md`.
